.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH lrat-auth 1  lrat 
.SH NAME
lrat\-auth \- Manage the Linear API key
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlrat auth\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the Linear API key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
lrat\-auth\-login(1)
Check an API key with Linear and store it in the configured keyring
.TP
lrat\-auth\-status(1)
Show where the API key comes from, and its workspace and viewer
.TP
lrat\-auth\-logout(1)
Delete the API key from the configured keyring
